Architecture: mirrors the established feature-view contract — a `DiskForecastSource`
state-holder seam (P1/S8) with an `InMemoryDiskForecastSource`, an `@Observable`
`DiskForecastPageModel`, and a pure `DiskForecastProjection`. SI/format conversion
happens only at the display boundary via the pure adapter (ADR-005). All strings
resolve from `Localizable.xcstrings` via `String(localized:defaultValue:)` keeping
the web key names (ADR-014). Components reused from the P3 library (TSGlassPanel,
TSAlertBanner, TSEmptyState, TSStatGridSkeleton, TSTableSkeleton, TSBadge, TSCard,
TSFadeIn, typography). The hypertable table is a scoped read-only adaptive grid
(the web disk-forecast table is read-only, no selection): columnar Grid on macOS /
regular width, card list on compact iPhone width (ADR-002/ADR-006).

Data source note (ADR-013): useDiskForecast is a REST query, NOT a live SSE
stream, so there is no >2-min staleness subscription (the SSE/staleness clause is
conditional on a live source). `refresh()` + pull-to-refresh re-request the source.

